88,west,"To complete the task, I need to find the stairs down. Since I've already explored some areas and found the stairs up, I will focus on unexplored regions. My plan is to methodically explore the level by moving in different directions, using the 'search' action periodically to look for hidden doors or passages. I will avoid moving up the stairs as it seems to lead away from my goal. If I find a door, I will use the 'open' action to open it. If I encounter a locked door or chest, I will use the 'kick' action to try and open it. Once I find the stairs down, I will take them to complete the task. I will also keep track of my surroundings and adjust my plan as needed based on new information. Since my current location is near the stairs up, I will move west to explore other areas of the level.","message:


